{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542","id":4569699280,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABEGAT0A","number":2542,"title":"【强烈反馈】自动运行仍频繁要求手动确认，SOLO 长任务体验被彻底打断","user":{"login":"htazq","id":61930738,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTMwNzM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61930738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq","html_url":"https://github.com/htazq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htazq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-02T08:12:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T06:58:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"我已经在 Trae / SOLO 里配置了“自动运行”，但实际使用中仍然频繁要求手动点击“运行”。\n\n问题不是偶发，而是长期存在，已经严重影响 Agent 长任务体验。\n\n我的诉求很明确：\n\n1. 如果产品里选择了“自动运行”，就应该明确哪些命令会自动运行、哪些命令不会自动运行。\n2. 如果 rm / Remove-Item / Copy-Item / 跨工作区文件操作会被强制拦截，就不要把这个模式命名成“自动运行”，这会误导用户。\n3. 现在的问题是：用户以为已经配置好了自动运行，结果 Agent 跑到一半卡在确认按钮上，几个小时后才发现任务根本没继续执行。\n4. 对 SOLO / Agent 产品来说，这不是小体验问题，而是核心能力断裂。长任务、自动测试、自动构建、自动清理临时文件，全都会被这个确认弹窗打断。\n5. 安全我能理解，但现在的设计太粗暴：要么全挡，要么不解释。建议提供更细粒度的策略：\n\n- 允许用户自定义可信工作区\n- 允许用户自定义命令白名单 / 黑名单\n- 白名单不要只做关键字匹配，而要解析完整命令\n- 对删除命令支持“仅允许删除当前工作区内临时目录”\n- 支持“本次会话信任”\n- 支持“本项目永久信任”\n- 对被强制拦截的命令，在 UI 上明确标注“该命令即使开启自动运行也不会自动执行”\n\n现在最让人难受的是：设置里写着自动运行，实际又不是自动运行。用户不是怕安全拦截，而是怕产品行为不透明、不一致、没法预期。\n\n如果 Trae 团队自己真的长期用 SOLO 跑项目，应该很容易复现这个痛点：Agent 自动改代码、跑测试、清理文件、复制构建产物，然后突然卡在一个确认按钮上。这个体验非常割裂。\n\n希望官方不要再只回复“为了安全”就结束。安全策略可以保留，但必须给高级用户一个可控、可解释、可配置的自动化权限模型。\n\n现在这个设计的实际效果是：看起来像 Agent，跑起来像半自动脚本，还得用户守在旁边点按钮。这和 SOLO 的产品定位是冲突的。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4698547912","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542#issuecomment-4698547912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542","id":4698547912,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABGA4myA","user":{"login":"dklsgui","id":60007520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDA3NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60007520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui","html_url":"https://github.com/dklsgui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dklsgui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-13T12:41:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T12:41:23Z","body":"强烈支持，本来睡觉之前都设置好自动执行，结果醒来发现还卡在第一步","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4698547912/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4932806185","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542#issuecomment-4932806185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2542","id":4932806185,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABJgSmKQ","user":{"login":"doyouhaobaby","id":2012511,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI1MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2012511?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby","html_url":"https://github.com/doyouhaobaby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doyouhaobaby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T06:58:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T06:58:22Z","body":"这个项目被放弃了，很久没有更新","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4932806185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}